linscreencapture (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * Area screenshot capture with visual overlay
  * Annotation tools: arrow, rectangle, circle, text, freehand
  * Screenshot history with thumbnails
  * System tray integration with minimize-to-tray
  * Auto clipboard copy and auto-save on capture
  * Configurable keyboard shortcuts (PrintScreen, Ctrl+Print, etc.)
  * Set as default screenshot app option
  * Save with sequential filename numbering
  * Single-instance support via lock file

 -- MensuraMedia <mensuramedia@gmail.com>  Sat, 28 Mar 2026 12:00:00 +0000
